{"v":4,"catch":"宣布該城市為戰區。","desc":"《VENDETTA》是KONAMI於1991年推出的一款動作遊戲。\n玩家為拯救被“Dead End Gang”綁架的朋友的妹妹而戰。\n選擇要玩的四個彩色角色之一。\n此遊戲還支持最多四名玩家同時進行遊戲。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-07-21","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6654f597b27e9852adf85952c62df57ec83fbdba4faa48cdf8626eadbc07b4df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77e96f89f7fc4b82a5780656aa4df240b04c2d7815825e24006c0f6eeec137a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf856c08da4f345c97072235dab05014eaead81ab11222172299e6654ae337a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa4e69b7436cbf633f6552b61526431ab42449b04e04589431b9750d76947ef4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/48929a2b97527f0d9c2423891b5179e8e64c4d1651122e0b0d99ddc9bd80e286.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e4e66e533abeca07f1b547d3b4e4545b0b9424b451ee617f3216b69fd6c25c0e.jpg"],"titleId":"010087d0150be000","dlc":[]}